{"alias":"/schools/nutrition/studenteligibility","title":"Student Eligibility & Applications","changed":"2026-09-11T15:12:22+00:00","before":"<p class=\"text-align-center\"><strong>If you have questions regarding Student Eligibility and Applications, please contact a member of the <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/schools/nutrition/resources/contact\">Child Nutrition staff</a>.</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"3560cd99-1a48-4879-92e1-a3df2abdf126\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - SY2027 Operation Status - 8.19.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20SY2027%20Operation%20Status%20-%208.19.2026.pdf\">SY2027 Operation Status</a>&nbsp;(CEP, SPII, Traditional)</li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/SWnfJ79kFL0\">Direct Certification</a> - Updated September 2026</li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/KMRqHvH-we4\">Direct Certification List, Applications &amp; Verification Webinar</a>&nbsp;- May 12, 2026</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"31864f8f-4b49-4632-9634-29320725e2de\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - What Application and Accountability System Can I Use  - 12.7.2023.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20What%20Application%20and%20Accountability%20System%20Can%20I%20Use%20%20-%2012.7.2023.pdf\">What Application and Accountability System Can I Use</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<dl class=\"ckeditor-accordion\">\r\n\t<dt>Direct Certification</dt>\r\n\t<dd>\r\n\t<p>Direct certification is a process conducted by the states and by local educational agencies (LEAs) to certify eligible children for free meals without the need for household applications.</p>\r\n\r\n\t<p><strong>For Child Nutrition Purposes:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t<p>Child Nutrition regulations require every school district to review the direct certification list at least three times during the school year. The Department suggest at the beginning of each quarter.&nbsp;Direct certification is the FIRST method to approve a student's eligibility with no application or other documentation.&nbsp;When a student submits an application and is already captured on the direct certification list, that application should be kept on file in a folder of direct certified students/families.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t</dd>\r\n\t<dt>Free and Reduced Applications</dt>\r\n\t<dd>\r\n\t<p><a href=\"/doe/schools/nutrition/financial/guidelines\">Federal Meal Reimbursement Rates and Eligibility Guidelines</a>&nbsp;-Current and previous years reimbursement rates, eligibility guidelines, and USDA food rates as well as the Catalog of Federal Domestic Assistance.</p>\r\n\r\n\t<p><strong>School Year 2027&nbsp;Public Schools that are Non-Pricing</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"57d331ef-d1df-48af-b6d3-508af2981810\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Parent Letter No Charge Meals Public Schools - 4.29.2026.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Parent%20Letter%20No%20Charge%20Meals%20Public%20Schools%20-%204.29.2026.docx\">Parent Letter for F/R Meals (for Public Schools)</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"640ad217-5edf-49de-902c-ada80baf0e6c\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Household Application for Free and Reduced Price School Meals - 4.29.2026.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Household%20Application%20for%20Free%20and%20Reduced%20Price%20School%20Meals%20-%204.29.2026.docx\">2027&nbsp;Meal Benefit Application and Instructions</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-msword file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"6dcc9f85-d642-4c34-abd2-d35856c7b6ee\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Eligibility Notification Letter for No Charge Meals Public Schools - 5.21.2025.doc\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Eligibility%20Notification%20Letter%20for%20No%20Charge%20Meals%20Public%20Schools%20-%205.21.2025.doc\">Eligibility Notification Letter (for Public Schools)</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"333e1591-7d14-4e98-9b5e-b79772a67a3d\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Direct Certification Notification Letter - 5.21.2025_0.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Direct%20Certification%20Notification%20Letter%20-%205.21.2025_0.docx\">Direct Certification Eligibility Notification Letter</a></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\r\n\t<p><strong>School Year 2027&nbsp;Private Schools that are Charging for &nbsp;Meals</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"57a35ba6-ec2a-43e6-954a-a8780c892e99\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Parent Letter Charging Meals Private Schools - 4.29.2026.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Parent%20Letter%20Charging%20Meals%20Private%20Schools%20-%204.29.2026.docx\">Parent Letter for F/R Meals (for Private Schools)</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Household%20Application%20for%20Free%20and%20Reduced%20Price%20School%20Meals%20-%204.29.2026.docx\">2027&nbsp;Meal Benefit Application and Instructions</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-msword file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"83542862-8f87-4d79-82e5-994fdf45dec9\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Eligibility Notification Letter for Charging Meals Private Schools - 5.21.2025.doc\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Eligibility%20Notification%20Letter%20for%20Charging%20Meals%20Private%20Schools%20-%205.21.2025.doc\">Eligibility Notification Letter (for Private Schools)</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Direct%20Certification%20Notification%20Letter%20-%205.21.2025_0.docx\">Direct Certification Eligibility Notification Letter</a></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\r\n\t<p><strong>School Year 2026 Public Schools that are Non-Pricing</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"7f47b3ff-4177-4b6d-aa21-738ffa1f1096\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Parent Letter No Charge Meals - 5.21.2025.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Parent%20Letter%20No%20Charge%20Meals%20-%205.21.2025.docx\" title=\"Child Nutrition - Parent Letter No Charge Meals - 5.21.2025\">Parent Letter for No Charge Meals</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"b2f4c616-9c01-4c5b-a1d6-96c7f0c223aa\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Household Application for Free and Reduced Price School Meals - 5.21.2025.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Household%20Application%20for%20Free%20and%20Reduced%20Price%20School%20Meals%20-%205.21.2025.docx\" title=\"Child Nutrition - Household Application for Free and Reduced Price School Meals - 5.21.2025\">Household Application for Free and Reduced Price School Meals</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-msword file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"11094848-8c45-4fbd-af31-c7b9f5722872\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Eligibility Notification Letter for No Charge Meals - 5.21.2025.doc\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Eligibility%20Notification%20Letter%20for%20No%20Charge%20Meals%20-%205.21.2025.doc\" title=\"Child Nutrition - Eligibility Notification Letter for No Charge Meals - 5.21.2025\">Eligibility Notification Letter for No Charge Meals</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"9af7f9f3-e2af-45b5-ad6a-a061613904fb\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Direct Certification Notification Letter - 5.21.2025.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Direct%20Certification%20Notification%20Letter%20-%205.21.2025.docx\" title=\"Child Nutrition - Direct Certification Notification Letter - 5.21.2025\">Direct Certification Notification Letter</a></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\r\n\t<p><strong>School Year 2026 Private Schools that are Charging for Meals</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"a174d5c3-7986-4ca7-9f1e-23330267d864\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Parent Letter Charging Meals - 5.21.2025.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Parent%20Letter%20Charging%20Meals%20-%205.21.2025.docx\">Parent Letter for Charging&nbsp;Meals</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"b2f4c616-9c01-4c5b-a1d6-96c7f0c223aa\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Household Application for Free and Reduced Price School Meals - 5.21.2025.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Household%20Application%20for%20Free%20and%20Reduced%20Price%20School%20Meals%20-%205.21.2025.docx\" title=\"Child Nutrition - Household Application for Free and Reduced Price School Meals - 5.21.2025\">Household Application for Free and Reduced Price School Meals</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-msword file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"2710f703-b956-4073-96e3-751fda9d8e01\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Eligibility Notification Letter for Charging Meals - 5.21.2025.doc\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Eligibility%20Notification%20Letter%20for%20Charging%20Meals%20-%205.21.2025.doc\">Eligibility Notification Letter for Charge Meals</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"9af7f9f3-e2af-45b5-ad6a-a061613904fb\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Direct Certification Notification Letter - 5.21.2025.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Direct%20Certification%20Notification%20Letter%20-%205.21.2025.docx\" title=\"Child Nutrition - Direct Certification Notification Letter - 5.21.2025\">Direct Certification Notification Letter</a></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\r\n\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t</dd>\r\n\t<dt>Special Milk Program&nbsp;</dt>\r\n\t<dd>\r\n\t<p><strong>School Year 2027</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"27c61303-cbed-4399-81c1-5224b7a3f25d\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Household Application Special Milk Program - 4.29.2026.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Household%20Application%20Special%20Milk%20Program%20-%204.29.2026.docx\">Household Application Special Milk Program</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"aab23ac6-8942-453f-9750-a7089a3a8fa0\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Parent Letter Special Milk Program - 4.29.2026.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Parent%20Letter%20Special%20Milk%20Program%20-%204.29.2026.docx\">Parent Letter Special Milk Program</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-msword file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"973ee584-45d1-452a-9d63-314e44b20cbe\" filename=\"Child Nutritoin - Eligibility Notification Letter Special Milk Program - 5.21.2025_0.doc\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutritoin%20-%20Eligibility%20Notification%20Letter%20Special%20Milk%20Program%20-%205.21.2025_0.doc\">Eligibility Notification Letter Special Milk Program</a></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\r\n\t<p><strong>School Year 2026</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"915eb7e0-a33b-47ee-8567-a201fec27697\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Household Application Special Milk Program - 5.21.2025.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Household%20Application%20Special%20Milk%20Program%20-%205.21.2025.docx\" title=\"Child Nutrition - Household Application Special Milk Program - 5.21.2025\">Household Application Special Milk Program</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"a9ae3f82-edcc-42fe-a40f-6c5ba8eb9d39\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Parent Letter Special Milk Program - 5.21.2025.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Parent%20Letter%20Special%20Milk%20Program%20-%205.21.2025.docx\" title=\"Child Nutrition - Parent Letter Special Milk Program - 5.21.2025\">Parent Letter Special Milk Program</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-msword file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"687987a6-f141-4657-9acd-9f4ba8014f13\" filename=\"Child Nutritoin - Eligibility Notification Letter Special Milk Program - 5.21.2025.doc\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutritoin%20-%20Eligibility%20Notification%20Letter%20Special%20Milk%20Program%20-%205.21.2025.doc\" title=\"Child Nutritoin - Eligibility Notification Letter Special Milk Program - 5.21.2025\">Eligibility Notification Letter Special Milk Program</a></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</dd>\r\n\t<dt>Verification</dt>\r\n\t<dd>\r\n\t<p>Verification is a confirmation of a percent of eligibility for free and reduced price applications under the National School Lunch Program or Breakfast Program.&nbsp;It must include either confirmation of income eligibility or confirmation that the child is included in a currently certified food stamp household or TANF (Temporary Assistance for Needy Families) unit.&nbsp;At State or local discretion, it may also include confirmation of any other information on the application, which is required as a condition of eligibility.</p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/iwpuRBgHJFk\">SY2025&nbsp;Verification Training&nbsp;</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"f41fe8ae-1237-44b9-9b8b-eb4d15feb0a5\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - Verification Training  - 09.18.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Verification%20Training%20%20-%2009.18.2024.pdf\">SY2025&nbsp;Verification Training</a> (PDF)</li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"da08b224-1718-4170-8e32-950a2a6e0293\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - CNPweb Verification Cheat Sheet - 1.28.25.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20CNPweb%20Verification%20Cheat%20Sheet%20-%201.28.25.pdf\">CNPweb Verification Cheat Sheet</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"12bb2614-95bc-417d-bcbd-30e4209d5987\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/SFA%20ID%20Codes%20as%20of%207.23.19_0.pdf\">District SFA ID Codes</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"e6b77a5f-5873-42c6-89b0-02b9f21b4528\" filename=\"Child Nutrtion - Verification Report FNS742 -1.28.25.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrtion%20-%20Verification%20Report%20FNS742%20-1.28.25.pdf\" title=\"FNS-742\">FNS 742 Report - Schools</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"222ce127-63ed-4a80-a0cd-31aa477b0969\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Verification%20Procedure%20for%20Missing%20or%20Late%20Reports.docx\">Verification Procedure for Late Reports</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"62e06a9d-6e02-4e5d-b471-cda2d72a6b2c\" filename=\"Child Nutition - Verification Notification Letters - 8.28.25.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutition%20-%20Verification%20Notification%20Letters%20-%208.28.25.docx\">Verification Notification Letters</a>\r\n\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</dd>\r\n\t<dt>Resources&nbsp;</dt>\r\n\t<dd>\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://www.fns.usda.gov/cn/eligibility-manual-school-meals\">Eligibility Manual for School&nbsp;Meals -&nbsp; Determining and Verifying Eligibility</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"ca9ab770-dcf3-4b59-85fc-c4baf99ced8f\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - 2027 Maine Eligibility Quick Reference Guide - 8.17.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%202027%20Maine%20Eligibility%20Quick%20Reference%20Guide%20-%208.17.2026.pdf\">Maine Eligibility Quick&nbsp;Guide</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"c8126fab-2852-479d-8349-34754ed0db70\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - SUN Bucks Addition to the Direct Certification List - 9.10.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20SUN%20Bucks%20Addition%20to%20the%20Direct%20Certification%20List%20-%209.10.2026.pdf\">SUN Bucks Addition to the Direct Certification&nbsp;List</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"c64afcef-ecae-429d-aefd-c9e395759796\" filename=\"Child Nutrition - SUN Bucks NSLP Online App Guide - 8.21.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20SUN%20Bucks%20NSLP%20Online%20App%20Guide%20-%208.21.2026.pdf\" title=\"Child Nutrition - SUN Bucks NSLP Online App Guide - 8.21.2026.pdf\">SUN Bucks NSLP Online App Guide</a></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube\">\r\n<h3><strong>Contact</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Child Nutrition</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Phone:&nbsp;</strong><avayaelement class=\"contentWrapper\"><avayaelement callelement=\"+12076246842\" class=\"dcelink\" id=\"dceLink-1\" originaltext=\"207-624-6842\">207-624-6842</avayaelement></avayaelement><br />\r\n<strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:Child.Nutrition@maine.gov\">Child.Nutrition@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-eyebrow\">Child Nutrition</p>\n<p class=\"doe-contact-link\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-align-center\"><strong>If you have questions regarding Student Eligibility and Applications, please contact a member of the <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/schools/nutrition/resources/contact\">Child Nutrition staff</a>.</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20SY2027%20Operation%20Status%20-%208.19.2026.pdf\">SY2027 Operation Status</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span>&nbsp;(CEP, SPII, Traditional)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-item\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/SWnfJ79kFL0\">Direct Certification</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span> Updated September 2026</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-item\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/KMRqHvH-we4\">Direct Certification List, Applications &amp; Verification Webinar</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span> May 12, 2026</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20What%20Application%20and%20Accountability%20System%20Can%20I%20Use%20%20-%2012.7.2023.pdf\">What Application and Accountability System Can I Use</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ckeditor-accordion-container\">\n<dl class=\"ckeditor-accordion\">\n<dt><a href=\"#\">Direct Certification</a></dt>\n<dd>\r\n\t<p>Direct certification is a process conducted by the states and by local educational agencies (LEAs) to certify eligible children for free meals without the need for household applications.</p>\r\n\r\n\t<p><strong>For Child Nutrition Purposes:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t<p>Child Nutrition regulations require every school district to review the direct certification list at least three times during the school year. The Department suggest at the beginning of each quarter.&nbsp;Direct certification is the FIRST method to approve a student's eligibility with no application or other documentation.&nbsp;When a student submits an application and is already captured on the direct certification list, that application should be kept on file in a folder of direct certified students/families.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"ckeditor-accordion\">\n<dt><a href=\"#\">Free and Reduced Applications</a></dt>\n<dd>\r\n\t<p><a href=\"/doe/schools/nutrition/financial/guidelines\">Federal Meal Reimbursement Rates and Eligibility Guidelines</a>&nbsp;-Current and previous years reimbursement rates, eligibility guidelines, and USDA food rates as well as the Catalog of Federal Domestic Assistance.</p>\r\n\r\n\t<p><strong>School Year 2027&nbsp;Public Schools that are Non-Pricing</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Parent%20Letter%20No%20Charge%20Meals%20Public%20Schools%20-%204.29.2026.docx\">Parent Letter for F/R Meals (for Public Schools)</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Household%20Application%20for%20Free%20and%20Reduced%20Price%20School%20Meals%20-%204.29.2026.docx\">2027&nbsp;Meal Benefit Application and Instructions</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Eligibility%20Notification%20Letter%20for%20No%20Charge%20Meals%20Public%20Schools%20-%205.21.2025.doc\">Eligibility Notification Letter (for Public Schools)</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Direct%20Certification%20Notification%20Letter%20-%205.21.2025_0.docx\">Direct Certification Eligibility Notification Letter</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\r\n\t<p><strong>School Year 2027&nbsp;Private Schools that are Charging for &nbsp;Meals</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Parent%20Letter%20Charging%20Meals%20Private%20Schools%20-%204.29.2026.docx\">Parent Letter for F/R Meals (for Private Schools)</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Household%20Application%20for%20Free%20and%20Reduced%20Price%20School%20Meals%20-%204.29.2026.docx\">2027&nbsp;Meal Benefit Application and Instructions</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Eligibility%20Notification%20Letter%20for%20Charging%20Meals%20Private%20Schools%20-%205.21.2025.doc\">Eligibility Notification Letter (for Private Schools)</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Direct%20Certification%20Notification%20Letter%20-%205.21.2025_0.docx\">Direct Certification Eligibility Notification Letter</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\r\n\t<p><strong>School Year 2026 Public Schools that are Non-Pricing</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Parent%20Letter%20No%20Charge%20Meals%20-%205.21.2025.docx\" title=\"Child Nutrition - Parent Letter No Charge Meals - 5.21.2025\">Parent Letter for No Charge Meals</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Household%20Application%20for%20Free%20and%20Reduced%20Price%20School%20Meals%20-%205.21.2025.docx\" title=\"Child Nutrition - Household Application for Free and Reduced Price School Meals - 5.21.2025\">Household Application for Free and Reduced Price School Meals</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Eligibility%20Notification%20Letter%20for%20No%20Charge%20Meals%20-%205.21.2025.doc\" title=\"Child Nutrition - Eligibility Notification Letter for No Charge Meals - 5.21.2025\">Eligibility Notification Letter for No Charge Meals</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Direct%20Certification%20Notification%20Letter%20-%205.21.2025.docx\" title=\"Child Nutrition - Direct Certification Notification Letter - 5.21.2025\">Direct Certification Notification Letter</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\r\n\t<p><strong>School Year 2026 Private Schools that are Charging for Meals</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Parent%20Letter%20Charging%20Meals%20-%205.21.2025.docx\">Parent Letter for Charging&nbsp;Meals</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Household%20Application%20for%20Free%20and%20Reduced%20Price%20School%20Meals%20-%205.21.2025.docx\" title=\"Child Nutrition - Household Application for Free and Reduced Price School Meals - 5.21.2025\">Household Application for Free and Reduced Price School Meals</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Eligibility%20Notification%20Letter%20for%20Charging%20Meals%20-%205.21.2025.doc\">Eligibility Notification Letter for Charge Meals</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Direct%20Certification%20Notification%20Letter%20-%205.21.2025.docx\" title=\"Child Nutrition - Direct Certification Notification Letter - 5.21.2025\">Direct Certification Notification Letter</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\t</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"ckeditor-accordion\">\n<dt><a href=\"#\">Special Milk Program</a>&nbsp;</dt>\n<dd>\r\n\t<p><strong>School Year 2027</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Household%20Application%20Special%20Milk%20Program%20-%204.29.2026.docx\">Household Application Special Milk Program</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Parent%20Letter%20Special%20Milk%20Program%20-%204.29.2026.docx\">Parent Letter Special Milk Program</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutritoin%20-%20Eligibility%20Notification%20Letter%20Special%20Milk%20Program%20-%205.21.2025_0.doc\">Eligibility Notification Letter Special Milk Program</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\r\n\t<p><strong>School Year 2026</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Household%20Application%20Special%20Milk%20Program%20-%205.21.2025.docx\" title=\"Child Nutrition - Household Application Special Milk Program - 5.21.2025\">Household Application Special Milk Program</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Parent%20Letter%20Special%20Milk%20Program%20-%205.21.2025.docx\" title=\"Child Nutrition - Parent Letter Special Milk Program - 5.21.2025\">Parent Letter Special Milk Program</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutritoin%20-%20Eligibility%20Notification%20Letter%20Special%20Milk%20Program%20-%205.21.2025.doc\" title=\"Child Nutritoin - Eligibility Notification Letter Special Milk Program - 5.21.2025\">Eligibility Notification Letter Special Milk Program</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"ckeditor-accordion\">\n<dt><a href=\"#\">Verification</a></dt>\n<dd>\r\n\t<p>Verification is a confirmation of a percent of eligibility for free and reduced price applications under the National School Lunch Program or Breakfast Program.&nbsp;It must include either confirmation of income eligibility or confirmation that the child is included in a currently certified food stamp household or TANF (Temporary Assistance for Needy Families) unit.&nbsp;At State or local discretion, it may also include confirmation of any other information on the application, which is required as a condition of eligibility.</p>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/iwpuRBgHJFk\">SY2025&nbsp;Verification Training</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20Verification%20Training%20%20-%2009.18.2024.pdf\">SY2025&nbsp;Verification Training</a> <span class=\"doe-chip\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20CNPweb%20Verification%20Cheat%20Sheet%20-%201.28.25.pdf\">CNPweb Verification Cheat Sheet</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/SFA%20ID%20Codes%20as%20of%207.23.19_0.pdf\">District SFA ID Codes</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrtion%20-%20Verification%20Report%20FNS742%20-1.28.25.pdf\" title=\"FNS-742\">FNS 742 Report - Schools</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Verification%20Procedure%20for%20Missing%20or%20Late%20Reports.docx\">Verification Procedure for Late Reports</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutition%20-%20Verification%20Notification%20Letters%20-%208.28.25.docx\">Verification Notification Letters</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"ckeditor-accordion\">\n<dt><a href=\"#\">Resources</a>&nbsp;</dt>\n<dd>\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"https://www.fns.usda.gov/cn/eligibility-manual-school-meals\">Eligibility Manual for School&nbsp;Meals -&nbsp; Determining and Verifying Eligibility</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%202027%20Maine%20Eligibility%20Quick%20Reference%20Guide%20-%208.17.2026.pdf\">Maine Eligibility Quick&nbsp;Guide</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20SUN%20Bucks%20Addition%20to%20the%20Direct%20Certification%20List%20-%209.10.2026.pdf\">SUN Bucks Addition to the Direct Certification&nbsp;List</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Child%20Nutrition%20-%20SUN%20Bucks%20NSLP%20Online%20App%20Guide%20-%208.21.2026.pdf\" title=\"Child Nutrition - SUN Bucks NSLP Online App Guide - 8.21.2026.pdf\">SUN Bucks NSLP Online App Guide</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</dd>\n</dl>\n</div>\n<div id=\"contact\" class=\"contact-cube\">\r\n<h3>Contact</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Child Nutrition</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Phone:&nbsp;</strong>207-624-6842<br />\r\n<strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:Child.Nutrition@maine.gov\">Child.Nutrition@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-jump\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":["Heading levels skip: jumps h1 to h3. Needs a person.","514 words with no section headers at all — the biggest single improvement available here."],"decisions":[{"id":"filechip","on":true,"label":"Tag a document link with the format it opens","why":"35 links on this page open a file — 24 Word, 8 PDF, 3 Video — and say nothing about it, while others in the same list carry a tag because their author typed one. The format is read from the file name, so the list stops being half-labelled. No link text changes.","value":"35 links"},{"id":"itemdash","on":true,"label":"Drop the dash once the link is set apart","why":"2 of those it